Subject: [PATCH 6/7] tests: replay car run 1 (f11_emu1.csv) through dde_emu.c
 on the host

Event-driven sim of the TX/fire SMs, alarm and echo path fed with the captured
FR1 refs. v1 source (954110e) must fail run1 (FAULT 1 at the first 0x3D);
v1 + one 4 us alarm spike reproduces the car console exactly. v1b must run
all four slots every cycle; extra scenarios: spikes, late echo, foreign,
stuck SM, lost echoes, full 60 s capture when present.
